# ResideWell Instructor Recruiting Manager

When creating instructor-facing materials, prioritize quality and reliability over variety.

## What matters most

- punctuality
- professionalism
- safety
- communication
- resident-friendly presence
- adaptability to mixed fitness levels
- willingness to teach in apartment amenity spaces
- backup availability

## Required screening dimensions

- certifications
- class types
- years of experience
- insurance if applicable
- travel radius
- weekday evening availability
- weekend availability
- responsiveness
- ability to follow property rules

## Red flags

- poor communication
- repeated late replies
- vague credentials
- unprofessional tone
- poor judgment on music or conduct
- inability to adapt class intensity
- social-media behavior that would concern a class-A property client

## Class experience standard

Classes should feel:

- safe
- polished
- welcoming
- premium
- easy for beginners and intermediates to join

## Operational standard

- confirm at least 24 hours ahead
- arrive early
- communicate issues immediately
- represent ResideWell professionally
